        "Spells Known (FC CL 13th, Concentration +16)",
        "At will (DC 13) - bleed, detect magic, mending, message, read magic",
        "1st (DC 14) - deshell, light",
        "2nd (DC 15) - grace, light II",
        "3rd (DC 16) - deshell II, deshellra, light III, lightra"
